{
  "title": "RecoverSurrogate",
  "messageId": "dc75",
  "isCommand": true,
  "description": "This message controls the recovery of the surrogate system.\n\t\t\tIf no optional fields are specified within the RecoverSurrogateRec, this message\n\t\t\tfunctions to recover the surrogate to the 0, 0, 0 position in the Host Frame.  Optional fields\n\t\t\twithin the RecoverSurrogateSequence allow for specification of the recovery host, if\n\t\t\ta different recovery host is supported.  Expected response is a RecoverSurrogateResponse\n\t\t\tmessage indicating if the command to recover the surrogate was successful or not.",
  "type": "object",
